-- example_tool.lua.example — copy to tools/my_tool.lua to activate.
--
-- scope controls which agent can call this tool:
--   "architect" — planning agent only
--   "worker"    — execution agents only
--   "both"      — all agents
--
-- The only built-in is exec(cwd, command, arg1, arg2, ...) -> string
-- It runs a process in the project directory and returns combined output.
-- No shell, no pipes — named commands with explicit arguments only.

